Don't waste the potion going over, dig down (climb back up to kill
Medusa if you're after the perseus stuff-just be careful coming up
stairs if you lack reflection).

Then you can use the !levitation to get up.

Note that:
1. Jumping boots are sufficient to cross
2. Those !gain level that you've found can get you up if you curse
them.
3. Your quest artifact will levelport you when #invoked, if you have
telecontrol it's an easy way to go up/down. If not it's still a way up
if you have a bit of patience.  Ditto cursed ?teleport.
4. There are guaranteed boots of water walking at Vlad's, so you won't
get stuck completely--you're probably well strong enough to head there
if your AC's at least in the -15 range.
5. There's a wand of wishing in  the Castle.  =telecontrol or
=levitation may merit a wish, but polypiling rings and magic armor
(going for water walking/lev boots) might be smarter.  Wishing for as
many markers as possible, or at least 2-3, is probably good to get
better AC, more ?identify, etc.



